{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:00 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈邪惡角度自拍低胸上圍「胸湧跌蕩」  網民無禮性騷擾  本尊現身神回展超高EQ\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1af04142abf3afc3b1e0607afd941d61/2026-10/771_1.jpg\"/>\n<p>現年38歲、素有感女神之稱的崔碧珈（Anita），向來不吝嗇大晒魔鬼身材。日前她在社交平台分享一段戶外漫步自拍影片，一身超惹火裝束加上邪惡拍攝視角，短片一出即引發網民瘋狂洗版，更疑似遭到網民性騷擾，崔碧珈現身親自回覆盡展高EQ。</p>\n<h2>崔碧珈低胸背心邪惡高抄</h2>\n<p>短片中，崔碧珈在大風吹拂下依然狀態大勇，膚質白皙透亮且五官精緻。即使被強風吹亂秀髮，她仍對著鏡頭展露甜美燦爛笑容，手持水罐輕觸額頭，盡顯陽光自信。當日崔碧珈身穿桃紅色超低胸貼身背心，內搭黑色細肩帶，大方袒露豐滿上圍。她更以「邪惡高抄」視角邊走邊拍，隨著在顛簸沙灘步道闊步行走，傲人巨胸亦隨之瘋狂上下晃動，跌蕩畫面讓一眾網民大飽眼福。</p>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈憑《喜愛夜蒲》出道，成功以身材突圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50399ccb819e38380e140dcd1f560725/2023-01/ANITA45.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈早前與「大隻Rocky」鄭健樂鬧爆出感情糾紛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0c7105c83f2dc56210db1d98bc165f6/2023-01/ANITA27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈已經38歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/398c95721388cfd979a724304689c8a0/2026-10/Anita_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈懶理「大隻Rocky」鄭健樂風波，繼續過愜意生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a150dfc8f8d9e8e598320d3eccea7a0/2026-10/Anita_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈近日行山騷低胸上圍好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44442119a14d504af97861789d4e2296/2026-10/a1_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈靚爆鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3bbde32d40f21a357415b725ddf2b05/2026-10/a2_0_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈早前在IG分享到珠海的五星級酒店度假照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9b998d791bb757488de77d68e54ea83/2026-10/Anita_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈好識享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54275b8a65df2d67e23e844635ce7403/2026-10/Anita_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈只穿浴袍好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6e9fdd94429f3fd4b9373f88e35e63c/2026-10/Anita_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈曝光床照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b92c808979d4b2f9c9821d237aefc7bc/2026-10/Anita_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈大晒美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6696ed03863a6f4817f77f441c5b0aaf/2026-10/Anita_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈浸浴擺甫士極誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5d6bcb70bffcf2fadc36c27cfbbee9f/2026-10/Anita_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈分享出浴照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f8bb466188907083534bb287c6bf8c2/2026-10/Anita_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈撰文有感而發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa92c58ffecad318756a0922403ae5af/2026-10/Anita_15_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>網民留言好震崔碧珈神回</h2>\n<p>碧珈在貼文中大談「Me Time」心靈雞湯，表示在海邊漫步非常治癒，更指懂得愛自己、寵自己的女生最靚。然而短片焦點全落在其身材上，除了讚賞聲外，亦有網民留言調侃甚至帶性騷擾意味：「好震啊」、「你唔好震，得唔得呀」。面對露骨留言，崔碧珈親自以超高情商幽默回覆：「好難唔手震㗎自拍」，巧妙以「手震」轉移「胸震」視線，四兩撥千斤化解尷尬，獲網民大讚EQ極高。此外，亦有網民指其上圍晃動自然，力撐是「真材實料」絕無僭建，崔碧珈則未有回應。</p>\n<h2>崔碧珈曾遭露骨追問舊愛隱私</h2>\n<p>崔碧珈今次雖幽默應對，但面對惡意騷擾向來絕不姑息。早前她分享運動照時，曾有網民公然粗俗追問其緋聞舊愛鄭健樂（Rocky）的性能力隱私：「RockyXX勁嗎？」該無禮提問隨即觸怒崔碧珈，她毫不客氣公開反擊：「唔尊重女性嘅人太多，別忘記自己母親都是女性！」 直斥對方缺乏教養。面對不同言論，崔碧珈剛柔並濟的處理方式再次贏得讚賞。</p>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈曾分享與「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4daf7d82f54de1915a43fede5f77abca/2025-12/002_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭健樂曾接受傳媒訪問時晒與崔碧珈「拍拖證據」，並承認破產，亦表示崔碧珈主動問他「有冇新女朋友」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6df57e8017e7fbe85353f007a2a42d47/2026-03/22_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭健樂透露破產令還有兩、三年才屆滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a0683f748f524fce4d57563ec650fc3/2025-08/A20_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂即使被女方多番拒紹，在IG仍見到「私人健身教練」，以及「@anitachui」崔碧珈的IG。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db589cf3fe06efe2b83acb8532c0e92b/2026-01/rocky_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈回應戀上「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂，僅稱對方是好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef9b23769cf700fda46c02eac16cc9d9/2025-12/003_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂疑猴擒搶先認愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95f5f0eca0a3850a2b4de55b53e5b6b8/2025-12/004_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂去年12月17日在FB撰長文，正式交代與崔碧珈的感情問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3252ca573419568d36ebcdd57c22d6a1/2025-12/Rocky_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂稱認識崔碧珈一星期，想追求對方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd0b1c26715398876f0127eb9a8e16f/2025-12/Rocky_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈曾稱與「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂進展快，讚對方是難得的好異性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b822bc71b9fc8e4ea2a6b9525342da46/2025-12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-14_at_5_51_03_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原來「大隻佬Rocky」鄭健樂單方面公開戀情，崔碧珈表示：「非常好好好朋友，我真係覺得係私人事，兩個人知就得！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3fce5957ff3a5e760a49b511226814ec/2025-12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-14_at_5_51_03_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈為父女戀傳復合解畫？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4e0ab377938f5ceaba2d6efeeed687a/2026-04/anitachui_1775801452_48343584_mp4_snapshot_00_00_324.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈早前曾於IG訴心聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef51ae78f6cc66bccff7c40b7dee7560/2026-04/51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭健樂早前於IG上載「崔樂戀」三字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c562cd0334eb68f77946221bd05ac7/2026-04/324_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭健樂公開與崔碧珈的戀愛證據。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4415651f50d7304610cb3b1522beb677/2025-08/A19_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Rocky鄭健樂早前於IG開設了名為「崔樂戀」的限時動態精選。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/436497ac6cf8b08b022c67b3cf3fe23f/2026-04/1_5_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Rocky為小狗開IG，標註了自己和崔碧珈的IG帳戶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/341ab2e7d7dbdf06c23eb17f04073dc0/2026-04/2_5_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「大隻Rocky」鄭健樂早前在IG限時動態發文，疑似反擊崔碧珈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/964a2dcffc336e943d81edf664719fa8/2026-09/rocky_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈近年形象大變。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88da12781c26b5f0d95622876c79f7b6/2023-01/ANITA37.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈早前曾在美國拍劇拍戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea90c21544bf1f3e154d42c986640bc0/2023-01/ANITA34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈是性感女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/725896c77d02dc6f03d6336afd358db8/2023-01/ANITA35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈一向衣著豪放大膽，不時大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63913b4eabb0ee0852aa68a65b9788f4/2026-04/3663406795478313339_48343584.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈自出道以來一直走性感路線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d092ee097dd3e97caf09ec3f946be35/2023-01/ANITA44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95f4b34a50e7594c770f3b4c1d3b88b4/2023-01/ANITA43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈近年長期在美國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3307ce070ee81550f844670051e9f932/2023-01/ANITA42.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈自從與黃柏高結束合作關係後形象大變。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5efbff1a6ad7933ccf4b3a9e348a36f/2023-01/ANITA41.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈早前分享行山照，側身靠在大石旁，黑色運動帽配超深V紅色背心，導彈級身材極致吸睛！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75448245b5681835be799dfe54229138/2026-09/_1__Anita_Chui__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單手扶帽展露招牌陽光笑容，緊身深V紅色吊帶背心讓其豐滿上圍呼之欲出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7659f7ec03fbbe5e6b77e40dc435e9e8/2026-09/_6__Anita_Chui__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈富貴生活令人艷羨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dcd3f3ca798caaa1bb04dc2e09f2663/2023-01/ANITA25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"崔碧珈有一段時間在美國，向歌影視三棲發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ba901d8a8606f83338b6725632589ee/2023-01/ANITA22.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:07.018066+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":724,"images":44,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:37.040393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:37.040393+00:00","content_hash":"dbdfeea44b6ce15a5942547554fe38cda66cf289a73dc613ee5072d4d3214966","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}